{"available_actions":[{"name":"QUERY_MEMORY","kind":"harness","description":"Search Evidence, Finding, Candidate Source, Report, and unreported Workspace Task cards. Workspace tasks include saved run status and errors; reported tasks are searchable as reports.","signature":"{query:string, record_types?:[candidate|evidence|finding|report|workspace_task], cursor?:integer}"},{"name":"READ_RECORD","kind":"harness","description":"Read a saved record by ID. Long text or structured records return content pages; pass next_offset as offset to continue. Image Evidence can supply pixels for review. New frame extraction, cropping or transcription belongs in a Workspace.","signature":"{record_id:string, offset?:integer}"}],"global_view":{"task":"核查以下声明，必要时检查给定媒体并搜索外部证据。依据实际证据回答，说明结论范围与不确定性：Fire and smoke billowing from the vicinity of the Eiffel Tower were evidence of a Bastille Day terrorist attack in Paris.","original_materials":[{"reference_id":"C0","content":"{"task":"核查以下声明，必要时检查给定媒体并搜索外部证据。依据实际证据回答，说明结论范围与不确定性：Fire and smoke billowing from the vicinity of the Eiffel Tower were evidence of a Bastille Day terrorist attack in Paris."}","truncated":false},"E1 [video] 材料 A ← I0 (HARNESS/ingest)"],"current_materials":["E18 [text] ALERTE : incendie au pied de la Tour Eiffel 14 Juillet 2016 ← R12 (SEARCH/open/yt-dlp)","E19 [image] cover: ALERTE : incendie au pied de la Tour Eiffel 14 Juillet 2016 ← R12 (SEARCH/open/yt-dlp+http)","E20 [text] Eiffel Tower Set Ablaze by Terrorists | Snopes.com ← R20 (SEARCH/open/http+trafilatura)","E23 [text] Préfecture de Police on X: "Ne propagez pas de fausses rumeurs. Aucun incendie à la #TourEiffel. Un incendie accidentel de camion a eu lieu pont d'Iéna. Il est éteint." / X ← R22 (SEARCH/open/http+trafilatura)","E24 [text] ALERTE : incendie au pied de la Tour Eiffel 14 Juillet 2016 ← R26 (SEARCH/open/yt-dlp)","E25 [image] cover: ALERTE : incendie au pied de la Tour Eiffel 14 Juillet 2016 ← R26 (SEARCH/open/yt-dlp+http)","E2 [text] 媒体属性：video，25.100秒，1280×720，30.000fps，1条音轨 ← E1 (INSPECT/media_profile)","E3 [image] 视频E1在2.100秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E4 [image] 视频E1在6.267秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E5 [image] 视频E1在10.467秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E6 [image] 视频E1在14.633秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E7 [image] 视频E1在18.833秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E8 [image] 视频E1在23.000秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E26 [text] Smoke rises around Eiffel Tower ← R27 (SEARCH/open/yt-dlp)","E27 [image] cover: Smoke rises around Eiffel Tower ← R27 (SEARCH/open/yt-dlp+http)","E28 [image] 视频E1在0.000秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E29 [image] 视频E1在0.500秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E30 [image] 视频E1在1.000秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)","E31 [image] 视频E1在1.500秒的帧 ← E1 (INSPECT/get_frames)"],"latest_reports":[{"task":"核实给定视频E1与2016年7月14日巴黎埃菲尔铁塔附近意外卡车火灾的对应关系，以判断声明“Fire and smoke billowing from the vicinity of the Eiffel Tower were evidence of a Bastille Day terrorist attack in Paris.”是否适用于这段素材。现有警方通报已确认当日耶拿桥发生意外卡车火灾，但尚未确认E1就是该事件的视频。直接对照E1与候选公开视频https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YmDMziYntEs（已有元数据E18、封面E19）；必要时追查E20引用的视频https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cv_F3UkbdbI。依据可区分的画面细节、片段时序和来源信息，说明能否确认同一片段及其事件归属，区分上传日期与拍摄日期；若无法取得或对应，明确说明限制。","materials":["E1","E18","E19","E20","E23"],"run_status":"reported","report":{"task_id":"W2-1","status":"INCOMPLETE","finding_ids":["F7","F8","F9","F10"],"selected_evidence_ids":["E28","E29","E4","E19","E27","E3","E24","E26","E23","E20"],"status_reason":"候选公开视频仅取得封面和元数据，尚未建立与材料 A 的视频帧及片段时序对应，无法确认材料 A 就是所述意外卡车火灾的视频。","findings":[{"finding_id":"F7","workspace_id":"W2-1","statement":"材料 A 的0秒和0.5秒帧显示夜间埃菲尔铁塔、烟雾、河面及铁塔右下方的火光；6.267秒帧更近地显示岸边火光和烟雾。这些画面不能辨认起火车辆、起火原因或恐袭行为。","evidence_ids":["E28","E29","E4"],"limitations":["判断限于已观察的抽样帧；火光和烟雾本身不能证明恐怖袭击。"]},{"finding_id":"F8","workspace_id":"W2-1","statement":"候选 YmDMziYntEs 与 cv_F3UkbdbI 的封面在塔身平台转角、钢架构图、黄紫灯光及烟雾形态上高度一致，前者另有上下黑边，支持两候选封面使用同一画面。材料 A 所见照明及烟雾场景与这些封面相容，但尚不足以确认同一视频片段。","evidence_ids":["E19","E27","E28","E3"],"limitations":["封面对应不能证明两段完整视频相同，也不能证明材料 A 来自其中任何一个视频。","未取得候选视频的可比较帧，未建立跨视频时间锚点，无法判断连续对应、截取或编辑关系。"]},{"finding_id":"F9","workspace_id":"W2-1","statement":"两个候选视频的元数据均将上传日期列为2016年7月14日。YmDMziYntEs 的标题和描述也将内容标注为当日埃菲尔铁塔脚下火灾。这些信息是上传记录及来源标注，不能独立确定真实拍摄日期，也不能确定材料 A 的拍摄日期。","evidence_ids":["E24","E26"],"limitations":["上传日期不等于拍摄日期；材料 A 与候选视频的素材对应关系尚未确认。"]},{"finding_id":"F10","workspace_id":"W2-1","statement":"巴黎警方2016年7月14日通报称，耶拿桥发生的是已扑灭的意外卡车火灾，埃菲尔铁塔本身没有起火。Snopes 正文将 cv_F3UkbdbI 链接作为该事件被误传为恐袭的视频材料。因此，将这一已知事件的火烟解释为巴黎国庆日恐袭证据，与警方通报冲突。材料 A 的已见画面同样不足以支持恐袭声明，但其属于该事件的直接联系仍未确认。","evidence_ids":["E23","E20","E28","E4"],"limitations":["警方通报确认事件性质，没有直接鉴定材料 A。","Snopes 对链接视频的事件归属提供来源线索，不能替代材料 A 与该视频的实际片段对照。"]}]},"supporting_records":[{"evidence_id":"E24","modalities":["text"],"label":"ALERTE : incendie au pied de la Tour Eiffel 14 Juillet 2016","source_ref":"R26","acquired_by":"SEARCH/open/yt-dlp","locator":"video source fields: title, webpage_url, channel, upload_date, duration, description, extractor, live_status, video_id","content":"{"title":"ALERTE : incendie au pied de la Tour Eiffel 14 Juillet 2016","webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YmDMziYntEs","channel":"5,555,554 vues","upload_date":"20160714","duration":25,"description":"ALERTE : incendie au pied de la Tour Eiffel 14 Juillet 2016!","extractor":"Youtube","live_status":"not_live","video_id":"YmDMziYntEs"}"},{"evidence_id":"E26","modalities":["text"],"label":"Smoke rises around Eiffel Tower","source_ref":"R27","acquired_by":"SEARCH/open/yt-dlp","locator":"video source fields: title, webpage_url, channel, upload_date, duration, description, extractor, live_status, video_id","content":"{"title":"Smoke rises around Eiffel Tower","webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cv_F3UkbdbI","channel":"Rutnet","upload_date":"20160714","duration":25,"description":"Smoke rises around Eiffel Tower","extractor":"Youtube","live_status":"not_live","video_id":"cv_F3UkbdbI"}"},{"evidence_id":"E23","modalities":["text"],"label":"Préfecture de Police on X: "Ne propagez pas de fausses rumeurs. Aucun incendie à la #TourEiffel. Un incendie accidentel de camion a eu lieu pont d'Iéna. Il est éteint." / X","source_ref":"R22","acquired_by":"SEARCH/open/http+trafilatura","locator":"paragraph numbers embedded in extracted text","content":"[1] Préfecture de Police@prefpoliceNe propagez pas de fausses rumeurs. Aucun incendie à la #TourEiffel. Un incendie accidentel de camion a eu lieu pont d'Iéna. Il est éteint.10:33 PM · Jul 14, 2016657K2.4K"},{"evidence_id":"E20","modalities":["text"],"label":"Eiffel Tower Set Ablaze by Terrorists | Snopes.com","source_ref":"R20","acquired_by":"SEARCH/open/http+trafilatura","locator":"paragraph numbers embedded in extracted text","content":"[1] Just after a devastating [attack](https://www.reuters.com/article/us-france-crash-hollande-idUSKCN0ZV08R?mod=related&channelName=worldNews) in Nice, France, on 14 July 2016 — in which dozens of people were killed and still more wounded when a man identified as French-Tunisian drove a huge truck through a large crowd watching fireworks — rumors spread thick and fast, as they do after any mass casualty event.

[2] Nine hundred kilometers away in Paris, Bastille Day celebrants saw smoke begin to billow up around the Eiffel Tower — the result of an accidental [explosion](https://www.mirror.co.uk/news/world-news/panic-huge-plumes-smoke-billow-8425417) of fireworks being trucked across the nearby Jena Bridge — and must have thought Paris itself was under attack. But it wasn't, and the structure itself was never in flames.

[3] Fear-mongering extremist and conspiracy web sites seized upon photos and [video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cv_F3UkbdbI) of the event, however, misleadingly presenting them as "evidence" that the entire country was under coordinated attack. The Paris Police were quick to douse this speculation via social media. "Don't spread false rumors," read a boldface …[已截断 456 字符；READ_RECORD 可读全文]"},{"evidence_id":"E28","modalities":["image"],"label":"视频E1在0.000秒的帧","derived_from":["E1"],"acquired_by":"INSPECT/get_frames","locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.033,"requested_time_s":0.0,"time_s":0.0}","content":"media_metadata_not_pixels","content_notice":"media_metadata_not_pixels"},{"evidence_id":"E29","modalities":["image"],"label":"视频E1在0.500秒的帧","derived_from":["E1"],"acquired_by":"INSPECT/get_frames","locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.033,"requested_time_s":0.5,"time_s":0.5}","content":"media_metadata_not_pixels","content_notice":"media_metadata_not_pixels"},{"evidence_id":"E4","modalities":["image"],"label":"视频E1在6.267秒的帧","derived_from":["E1"],"acquired_by":"INSPECT/get_frames","locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.033,"requested_time_s":6.275,"time_s":6.267}","content":"media_metadata_not_pixels","content_notice":"media_metadata_not_pixels"},{"evidence_id":"E19","modalities":["image"],"label":"cover: ALERTE : incendie au pied de la Tour Eiffel 14 Juillet 2016","source_ref":"R12","acquired_by":"SEARCH/open/yt-dlp+http","locator":"complete cover image","content":"media_metadata_not_pixels","content_notice":"media_metadata_not_pixels"},{"evidence_id":"E27","modalities":["image"],"label":"cover: Smoke rises around Eiffel Tower","source_ref":"R27","acquired_by":"SEARCH/open/yt-dlp+http","locator":"complete cover image","content":"media_metadata_not_pixels","content_notice":"media_metadata_not_pixels"},{"evidence_id":"E3","modalities":["image"],"label":"视频E1在2.100秒的帧","derived_from":["E1"],"acquired_by":"INSPECT/get_frames","locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.033,"requested_time_s":2.092,"time_s":2.1}","content":"media_metadata_not_pixels","content_notice":"media_metadata_not_pixels"}],"image_inputs":[{"evidence_id":"E25","derived_from":[],"locator":"complete cover image"},{"evidence_id":"E3","derived_from":["E1"],"locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.03333333333333333,"requested_time_s":2.091666666666667,"time_s":2.1}"},{"evidence_id":"E4","derived_from":["E1"],"locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.03333333333333333,"requested_time_s":6.275000000000001,"time_s":6.266666666666667}"},{"evidence_id":"E5","derived_from":["E1"],"locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.03333333333333333,"requested_time_s":10.458333333333334,"time_s":10.466666666666667}"},{"evidence_id":"E6","derived_from":["E1"],"locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.03333333333333333,"requested_time_s":14.641666666666667,"time_s":14.633333333333333}"},{"evidence_id":"E7","derived_from":["E1"],"locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.03333333333333333,"requested_time_s":18.825,"time_s":18.833333333333332}"},{"evidence_id":"E8","derived_from":["E1"],"locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.03333333333333333,"requested_time_s":23.008333333333336,"time_s":23.0}"},{"evidence_id":"E27","derived_from":[],"locator":"complete cover image"},{"evidence_id":"E28","derived_from":["E1"],"locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.03333333333333333,"requested_time_s":0.0,"time_s":0.0}"},{"evidence_id":"E29","derived_from":["E1"],"locator":"{"frame_duration_s":0.03333333333333333,"requested_time_s":0.5,"time_s":0.5}"},"…（另有 2 条未展示）"],"image_inputs_truncated":true,"visual_observation_summary":{"image_evidence_count":13,"videos":[{"evidence_id":"E1","observed_frame_count":10,"media_duration_s":25.1,"coverage_span_s":[0.0,25.1],"observed_ranges_s":[[0.0,0.03333333333333333],[0.5,0.5333333333333333],[1.0,1.0333333333333334],[1.5,1.5333333333333334],[2.1,2.1333333333333333],[6.266666666666667,6.3],[10.466666666666667,10.5],[14.633333333333333,14.666666666666666],[18.833333333333332,18.866666666666667],[23.0,23.033333333333335]],"unconfirmed_ranges_s"